.DS_Store

# Xcode
xcuserdata/
DerivedData/
build/

# 本机签名身份(Team ID),见 Config/Project.xcconfig
Config/Local.xcconfig

# 第三方源码与构建树(QEMU、glib、pixman、libusb、pkgconf),由 ThirdParty/qemu 下的脚本生成
ThirdParty/qemu/src/
ThirdParty/qemu/build/
ThirdParty/qemu/sysroot/
# virtio-win 的 ISO 与抽出来的 Windows 驱动,由 ThirdParty/virtio-win/fetch.sh 生成
ThirdParty/virtio-win/src/
ThirdParty/virtio-win/drivers/

# 二进制介质:固件变量、工具盘、磁盘镜像、ISO
*.fd
*.img
*.iso
*.qcow2
*.bin
